      "iso_date_of_last_edit": "2025-07-30T01:55:20Z",
      "text": "Avoid at all costs.Absolutely Horrific Experience. My Child Got Food Poisoning + Filthy Conditions.\n\nIf I could leave zero stars, I would. Our visit to seasons on July 2025 was one of the worst dining experiences we’ve ever had and it ended with my child getting severe food poisoning within 5 hours she had only chicken Beriyani.\nShe suffered a lot with vomiting, diarrhea, high fever n sever stomach aches.This was clearly caused by contaminated chicken that she consumed In Beriyani.\n\nAnd don’t even get me started on the condition of the women’s restroom — it was absolutely disgusting. Filthy toilets, literally feces and urine on floor and pungent stench.If the restroom is this unhygienic, I can only imagine what the kitchen looks like and seriously feel bad this restaurant workers .\n\nThis place is a health hazard, plain and simple. Strongly urge others to stay far away.\n\nNO CHILD SHOULD SUFFER BECAUSE OF SUCH NEGLEGENCE..",
      "text_original_language": "Avoid at all costs.Absolutely Horrific Experience. My Child Got Food Poisoning + Filthy Conditions.\n\nIf I could leave zero stars, I would. Our visit to seasons on July 2025 was one of the worst dining experiences we’ve ever had and it ended with my child getting severe food poisoning within 5 hours she had only chicken Beriyani.\nShe suffered a lot with vomiting, diarrhea, high fever n sever stomach aches.This was clearly caused by contaminated chicken that she consumed In Beriyani.\n\nAnd don’t even get me started on the condition of the women’s restroom — it was absolutely disgusting. Filthy toilets, literally feces and urine on floor and pungent stench.If the restroom is this unhygienic, I can only imagine what the kitchen looks like and seriously feel bad this restaurant workers .\n\nThis place is a health hazard, plain and simple. Strongly urge others to stay far away.\n\nNO CHILD SHOULD SUFFER BECAUSE OF SUCH NEGLEGENCE..",
